{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/10/5574023/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ い の顔( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"下らないことよく\nやりますよ( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何の顔か分からず\nねねにつっこまれました。\n『これ何の顔？』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とっさにとっさに\n『あ いの顔』と答えたのである！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからこの顔は誰が何と言おうと\n『あ いの顔』である！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は岡山の方でRSKさんの\n主催のライブに出演させて\n頂きました♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん最高に盛り上がって\n頂き嬉しいです。\nそしてなんといっても\n嬉しかったのがライブ中に\n見える『ようこそ岡山へ！』の文字"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それを見ていつも以上に\n来て良かったと実感しました(´;ω;`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの差し入れを頂きました。\nどれも美味しくて岡山にまた来たい！\nって凄く思いました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お土産にきなこ味のきびだんご。\n買いました(´･ω･`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/10/5574023/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きびだんぱわー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たんたんたん ゆったんたん( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"_"}],"source":"archive"}